applicable only for Immediate MDT. """ ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:ImmediateMdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

trace3gpp:ImmediateMdtConfig.collectionPeriodM7LTE a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "ImmediateMdtConfig.collectionPeriodM7LTE" ;
    rdfs:comment """It specifies the collection period for the Packet Loss Rate
measurement (M7) for LTE MDT taken by the eNB. The attribute is
