or M2 (only for UMTS).""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:ImmediateMdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig.areaConfigurationForNeighCell a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "LoggedMdtConfig.areaConfigurationForNeighCell" ;
    rdfs:comment """It specifies the area for which UE is requested to perform
measurement logging for neighbour cells which have list of frequencies.
If it is not configured, the UE shall perform measurement logging for
all the neighbour cells.

Applicable only to NR Logged MDT.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range trace3gpp:AreaConfig .

trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig.eventListForEventTriggeredMeasurement a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "LoggedMdtConfig.eventListForEventTriggeredMeasurement" ;
    rdfs:comment """Specifies event types for event triggered measurement in the
case of logged NR MDT.  Each trace session may configure at most one
event. The UE shall perform logging of measurements only upon certain
condition being fulfilled:
- Out of coverage.
- A2 event.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig.eventThresholdL1 a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "LoggedMdtConfig.eventThresholdL1" ;
    rdfs:comment """It specifies the threshold which should trigger
the reporting in case of event based reporting of logged NR MDT.
The attribute is applicable only for Logged MDT and when reportType
is configured for event triggered reporting and when
eventListForEventTriggeredMeasurement is configured for L1 event.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:unsignedInt .

trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig.hysteresisL1 a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "LoggedMdtConfig.hysteresisL1" ;
    rdfs:comment """It specifies the hysteresis used within the entry and leave
condition of the L1 event based reporting of logged NR MDT.
The attribute is applicable only for Logged MDT, when reportType
is configured for event triggered reporting and when
eventListForEventTriggeredMeasurement is configured for L1 event.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:unsignedInt .

trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig.loggingDuration a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "LoggedMdtConfig.loggingDuration" ;
    rdfs:comment """Specifies how long the MDT configuration is valid at the
UE in case of Logged MDT. The attribute is applicable only for
Logged MDT and Logged MBSFN MDT.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:unsignedInt .

trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig.loggingInterval a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "LoggedMdtConfig.loggingInterval" ;
    rdfs:comment """Specifies the periodicty for Logged MDT. The attribute is
applicable only for Logged MDT and Logged MBSFN MDT.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig.mbsfnAreaList a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "LoggedMdtConfig.mbsfnAreaList" ;
    rdfs:comment """The MBSFN Area consists of a MBSFN Area ID and Carrier
Frequency (EARFCN). The target MBSFN area List can have up to 8 entries.
This parameter is applicable only if the job type is Logged MBSFN MDT.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range trace3gpp:MbsfnArea .

trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig.nPNIdentityList a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "LoggedMdtConfig.nPNIdentityList" ;
    rdfs:comment """It defines which NPNs that can be served by the NR cell,
and which CAG IDs or NIDs can be supported by the NR cell for
corresponding PNI-NPN or SNPN in case of the cell is NPN-only cell.
(NPN-Identity referring to TS 38.331)""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range types3gpp:NpnId .

trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig.reportType a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "LoggedMdtConfig.reportType" ;
    rdfs:comment "It specifies report type for logged NR MDT" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig.timeToTriggerL1 a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "LoggedMdtConfig.timeToTriggerL1" ;
    rdfs:comment """It specifies the threshold which should trigger
the reporting in case of event based reporting of logged NR MDT.
The attribute is applicable only for Logged MDT, when reportType
is configured for event triggered reporting and when
eventListForEventTriggeredMeasurement is configured for L1 event.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:int .

trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig.traceCollectionEntityId a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "LoggedMdtConfig.traceCollectionEntityId" ;
    rdfs:comment """It specifies the TCE Id which is sent to the UE in
Logged MDT.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:long .

trace3gpp:MbsfnArea.earfcn a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "MbsfnArea.earfcn" ;
    rdfs:comment "Carrier Frequency" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:MbsfnArea ;
    rdfs:range xsd:unsignedInt .

trace3gpp:MbsfnArea.mbsfnAreaId a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "MbsfnArea.mbsfnAreaId" ;
    rdfs:comment "MBSFN Area Identifier" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:MbsfnArea ;
    rdfs:range xsd:unsignedInt .

trace3gpp:MdtConfig.anonymizationOfMdtData a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "MdtConfig.anonymizationOfMdtData" ;
    rdfs:comment """Specifies level of anonymization of MDT data.
This attribute is only applicable for management based activation.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:MdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

trace3gpp:MdtConfig.areaScope a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "MdtConfig.areaScope" ;
    rdfs:comment "It specifies the area where data shall be collected. " ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:MdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range types5g3gpp:AreaScope .

trace3gpp:MdtConfig.immediateMdtConfig a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "MdtConfig.immediateMdtConfig" ;
    rdfs:comment """The set of parameters specific for Immediate MDT
configuration.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:MdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range trace3gpp:ImmediateMdtConfig .

trace3gpp:MdtConfig.loggedMdtConfig a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "MdtConfig.loggedMdtConfig" ;
    rdfs:comment """The set of parameters specific for Logged MDT and Logged
MBSFN MDT configuration.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:MdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range trace3gpp:LoggedMdtConfig .

trace3gpp:MdtConfig.mNOnly a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "MdtConfig.mNOnly" ;
    rdfs:comment """Specifies whether the MDT configuration is for MN
only or not. The value FALSE means the MDT configuration is for
both MN and SN. The value TRUE means the MDT configuration is
for MN only.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:MdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:boolean .

trace3gpp:MdtConfig.plmnList a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "MdtConfig.plmnList" ;
    rdfs:comment """It indicates the PLMNs where measurement collection, status
indication and log reporting is allowed.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:MdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range smf3gpp:plmnList .

trace3gpp:MdtConfig.sensorInformation a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "MdtConfig.sensorInformation" ;
    rdfs:comment """It specifies which sensor information shall be included in
logged NR MDT and immediate NR MDT measurement if they are available.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:MdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

trace3gpp:MdtConfig.trsrPrefixCfg a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "MdtConfig.trsrPrefixCfg" ;
    rdfs:comment """The TRSR prefix configuration parameters which are used by
NR-RAN at TRSR assignment for a given C-MDT job. It defines both the
base TRSR prefix and the size of the TRSR prefix. The attribute
trstPrefix specifies the base TRSR prefix. The attribute
trsrPrefixLength defines the size of base TRSR prefix.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:MdtConfig ;
    rdfs:range trace3gpp:TrsrPrefixCfg .

trace3gpp:TraceConfig.listOfInterfaces a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "TraceConfig.listOfInterfaces" ;
    rdfs:comment """Specifies the interfaces that need to be traced in the given
ManagedEntityFunction.The attribute is applicable only for Trace. In
case this attribute is not used, it carries a null semantic.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:TraceConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

trace3gpp:TraceConfig.listOfNeTypes a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "TraceConfig.listOfNeTypes" ;
    rdfs:comment """Specifies the network element types where the trace should
be activated. The attribute is applicable only for Trace with
Signalling Based Trace activation.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:TraceConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

trace3gpp:TraceConfig.traceDepth a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "TraceConfig.traceDepth" ;
    rdfs:comment """It specifies the trace depth. The attribute is applicable
only for Trace.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:TraceConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

trace3gpp:TraceConfig.triggeringEvents a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "TraceConfig.triggeringEvents" ;
    rdfs:comment """It specifies the triggering event parameter of the trace
session. The attribute is applicable only for Trace.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:TraceConfig ;
    rdfs:range smf3gpp:triggeringEvents .

trace3gpp:TraceReference.mcc a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "TraceReference.mcc" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:TraceReference ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

trace3gpp:TraceReference.mnc a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "TraceReference.mnc" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:TraceReference ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

trace3gpp:TraceReference.traceId a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "TraceReference.traceId" ;
    rdfs:comment """An identifier, which identifies the Trace
(together with MCC and MNC). This is a 3 byte Octet String,
expressed in hexadecimal form e.g., '1a7b3d').""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:TraceReference ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

trace3gpp:TrsrPrefixCfg.trsrPrefix a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "TrsrPrefixCfg.trsrPrefix" ;
    rdfs:comment "A 2 byte Octet String. This is the base TRSR prefix" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:TrsrPrefixCfg ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

trace3gpp:TrsrPrefixCfg.trsrPrefixLength a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "TrsrPrefixCfg.trsrPrefixLength" ;
    rdfs:comment """An integer to indicate how many bits are used for the
TRSR prefix""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:TrsrPrefixCfg ;
    rdfs:range xsd:int .

trace3gpp:UECoreMeasConfig.nfTypeToMeasure a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "UECoreMeasConfig.nfTypeToMeasure" ;
    rdfs:comment """It indicates the type of NE to produce the 5GC UE level
measurements.

allowedValues: The NF types represented by the measured object
classes as defined by f) of the 5GC UE level measurements specified
in TS 28.558.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:UECoreMeasConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

trace3gpp:UECoreMeasConfig.objectInstances a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "UECoreMeasConfig.objectInstances" ;
    rdfs:comment """List of object instances.
Each object instance is identified by its DN.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:UECoreMeasConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

trace3gpp:UECoreMeasConfig.rootObjectInstances a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "UECoreMeasConfig.rootObjectInstances" ;
    rdfs:comment """List of root object instances.
Each object instance is identified by its DN and designates
the root of a substree that contains the root object and all
descendant objects.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:UECoreMeasConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

trace3gpp:UECoreMeasConfig.ueCoreMeasGranularityPeriod a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "UECoreMeasConfig.ueCoreMeasGranularityPeriod" ;
    rdfs:comment """Granularity period used to produce 5GC UE
level measurements. The period is defined in milliseconds (ms).""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:UECoreMeasConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:unsignedInt .

trace3gpp:UECoreMeasConfig.ueCoreMeasurements a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "UECoreMeasConfig.ueCoreMeasurements" ;
    rdfs:comment """List of 5GC UE level measurements identified by name.

The list may include 5GC UE level measurements defined in TS 28.558,
or vendor specific measurements.

For non-3GPP specified 5GC UE level measurements the name is defined
elsewhere.""" ;
    rdfs:domain trace3gpp:UECoreMeasConfig ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

